<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Topic Control</h4>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For topic control task, we generate text conditioned on four topics: <span id="A5.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">World</span>, <span id="A5.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Business</span>, <span id="A5.SS2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Sports</span>, and <span id="A5.SS2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Sci-Tech</span>. Using 20 prompts from PPLM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">2</a>]</cite>, we generate 20 sequences per topic. Adaptive allocation with smoothing factor of 0.6 with control lambda of 20000 is reported.</p>
</div>
